From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PeterXMR <xmrpeter@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 17:15:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: google: Add Pixel 6a (bluejay)

The Pixel 6a (bluejay) is a gs101 (Tensor) board like the Pixel 6 and
Pixel 6 Pro, and the binding's description already names it. Add its
compatible to the gs101 board list.

Assisted-by: Claude Fable 5.1
Signed-off-by: PeterXMR <xmrpeter@proton.me>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/google.yaml | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/google.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/google.yaml
index 988cf3de0..1f5258ae2 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/google.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/google.yaml
@@ -34,9 +34,10 @@ properties:
     const: '/'
   compatible:
     oneOf:
-      - description: Google Pixel 6 or 6 Pro (Oriole or Raven)
+      - description: Google Pixel 6, 6 Pro or 6a (Oriole, Raven or Bluejay)
         items:
           - enum:
+              - google,gs101-bluejay
               - google,gs101-oriole
               - google,gs101-raven
           - const: google,gs101
